Name	Type	Description	perspective	PerspectiveProxy	The perspective where this model will be stored	baseExpression?	string	Optional expression URI for this instance. If omitted, a random ad4m://obj/<id> IRI is generated, independent of any property content — this is what keeps two instances with identical property values distinct.	
Example
